{"title":"2017 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/2/1a2a0e7d69803ebf6d4145905e9ce40382b29007.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\times 111 - 2 \\times 111$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"141\" height=\"15\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/4/3245cc616d8eb0d7625a3c1256327ae7d213a2d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 222 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 333 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 444 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 555 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 666$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"479\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/e/b6e414254374a825fca0ae8ff4e0ee6b43dd3878.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\times 111 - 2 \\times 111 = 666 - 222$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"242\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/f/94faa4dd31c946af23232da187fbdcdd8b7ca0cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 444}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"95\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/f/a6faab6e04dcb654b44ae908a049c8b4ba71e1d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\times 111 - 2 \\times 111 = (6 - 2) \\times 111$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"270\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/e/65eb04f97cd7a72cc09b6623aa367e0e0ec224cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=4 \\times 111$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/f/94faa4dd31c946af23232da187fbdcdd8b7ca0cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 444}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"95\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-e